### stdin_write_all

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl stdin_write_all (stdin : threading.mutex_guard process_child_stdin) (text : string) : () =\n    backend_switch {\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            inl stream = text |> sm'.as_bytes\n            inl stdin = join stdin\n            (!\\($'\"true; let mut !stdin = !stdin\"') : bool) |> ignore\n            (!\\\\(stdin, $'\"true; std::io::Write::write_all(&mut *$0, !stream).unwrap()\"') : bool) |> ignore\n        // Rust: no join (a join point would clone the MutexGuard, which is not Clone).\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            inl stream = text |> sm'.as_bytes\n            (!\\\\((stdin, stream), $'\"true; std::io::Write::write_all(&mut *$0, $1).unwrap()\"') : bool) |> ignore\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl stdin_write_all (stdin : threading.mutex_guard process_child_stdin) (text : string) : () =
      backend_switch {
          Fsharp = fun () =>
              inl stream = text |> sm'.as_bytes
              inl stdin = join stdin
              (!\($'"true; let mut !stdin = !stdin"') : bool) |> ignore
              (!\\(stdin, $'"true; std::io::Write::write_all(&mut *$0, !stream).unwrap()"') : bool) |> ignore
          // Rust: no join (a join point would clone the MutexGuard, which is not Clone).
          Rust = fun () =>
              inl stream = text |> sm'.as_bytes
              (!\\((stdin, stream), $'"true; std::io::Write::write_all(&mut *$0, $1).unwrap()"') : bool) |> ignore
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

