### arg_default_missing_value

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl arg_default_missing_value (value : string) (arg : arg) : arg =\n    inl value = #value\n    backend_switch {\n        // clap keeps the value for the program's lifetime: default_missing_value wants a static str (a leaked one).\n        Rust = fun () => !\\\\((arg, value), $'\"$0.default_missing_value(&*Box::leak(String::from($1).into_boxed_str()))\"') : arg\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl arg_default_missing_value (value : string) (arg : arg) : arg =
      inl value = #value
      backend_switch {
          // clap keeps the value for the program's lifetime: default_missing_value wants a static str (a leaked one).
          Rust = fun () => !\\((arg, value), $'"$0.default_missing_value(&*Box::leak(String::from($1).into_boxed_str()))"') : arg
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

